<title>USA: GOLF-REMAINING THIRD-ROUND SCORES IN U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-REMAINING THIRD-ROUND SCORES IN U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>BETHESDA, Maryland 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third-round scores in the U.S. Open on Sunday of players who did not complete their rounds on Saturday (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>205  Tom Lehman 67 70 68</p>
<p>207  Jeff Maggert 73 66 68, Ernie Els (South Africa) 71 67 69</p>
<p>208  Colin Montgomerie (Britain) 65 76 67</p>
<p>210  Tommy Tolles 74 67 69, David Ogrin 70 69 71</p>
<p>211  Olin Browne 71 71 69, Scott Hoch 71 68 72</p>
<p>212  Hal Sutton 66 73 73, Stewart Cink 71 67 74</p>
<p>213  Jeff Sluman 69 72 72, Loren Roberts 72 69 72, Kelly      Gibson 72 69 72</p>
<p>214  Jose Maria Olazabal (Spain) 71 71 72, Hideki Kase (Japan)      68 73 73, Tiger Woods 74 67 73</p>
<p>215  Mark McNulty (Zimbabwe) 67 73 75</p>
<p>216  Scott Dunlap 75 66 75</p>
<p>219  Justin Leonard 69 72 78</p>
<p>223  Dave Schreyer 68 73 82</p>
<p>225  Dick Mast 73 69 83</p>
